- Confirm logistics: what time to arrive, how long to expect the hearing to take, courtroom rules for exhibits and electronics, parking, and whether any remote appearance option exists.
- Discuss collection strategy in advance — winning a judgment is one step; collecting can be a separate process (wage garnishment, writs of possession, levies).

