- Notices & procedural compliance
  - Did I properly serve the required notice(s) (3-day pay/quit, 30/60, cure/quit, etc.)? If there’s any doubt, how will that affect our case?
- Weaknesses & strategy
  - What are our case’s main weaknesses and the best ways to minimize them?
  - What’s our settlement posture? When should we consider settling and at what terms?
- Damages and remedies
  - Exactly what relief should I seek (past rent, future rent, damages, security deposit return, court costs, small claims limits)?
