- Role-play likely judge and opposing counsel questions so you can practice answers.

Finally — a brief legal note
I’m not your lawyer. These are organization and preparation suggestions. Use them to guide your discussion with Maria Santos, who will tailor legal strategy to local rules and your specific facts.

