- Motive questions: why are you bringing this now; any personal disputes unrelated to tenancy?  
- Hearsay/chain of custody attacks on documents (how were they created, who has them).  
- Attempts to reframe facts (e.g., “you agreed to X” or “you waived the notice”) — be prepared with dates/emails/messages.

Evidence & documents to bring and how to organize them
- Lease or rental agreement (signed pages).  
