A. Priority questions to ask Maria Santos (short, direct)
- What is the exact procedure and timeline now that discovery is closed? When will we likely get a hearing date?
- Who speaks first at the hearing and how long will each side have? Are there local time limits or page/exhibit limits for small claims in San Diego?
