- All communications (emails, texts, letters) printed with timestamps and saved originals/screenshots
- Photos/videos of unit condition (with dates) and damage estimates/invoices/receipts
- Repair estimates, paid invoices, contractor receipts
- Police reports, code enforcement or inspection reports (if any)
- Witness contact info and short written statements (if witnesses will attend)
- Timeline one-pager (concise chronology of key events)
- Exhibit list (numbered or lettered), and copies for judge, opposing counsel, and yourself
- Discovery documents produced by the other side that support your case
- Any settlement offers or release proposals

D. Practical courtroom prep, strategy, and conduct
