- Timeline document: concise one-page chronology of key dates (move-in, missed payments, notices, discovery events)
- Discovery documents exchanged (to show what was already produced)
- Any police reports, code enforcement complaints, or municipal notices relevant to habitability or conduct
- Identity documents showing who lived at the property if occupancy is disputed
- If claiming damages beyond rent, a clear spreadsheet showing how you calculated the total (with receipts)

