A. Quick clarification to confirm with Maria
- Confirm the court and case type: “Is this being handled in small claims court or as an unlawful detainer (eviction) in Superior Court?” (Evictions / unlawful detainer are normally in Superior Court in California; small claims is for limited monetary claims and has different rules, including restrictions on attorney courtroom representation.)
